    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Good Lovelies 20th Anniversary Christmas Concert"
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Good Lovelies Concert de noël - 20e anniversaire"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Canadian vocal harmony trio Good Lovelies’ much-loved Christmas Tour returns this December as they celebrate their 20th anniversary as a band! This show features holiday classics, winter favourites as well as the band’s original music that audiences have come to love over their two-decade career. Caroline Brooks, Kerri Ough and Susan Passmore are Juno Award-winning songwriters and multi-instrumentalists known for their rich harmonies and nostalgic sound. Blending folk-roots, old-time swing, bluegrass, pop and soul, their music is a perfect fit for the season. They’ll be joined on stage by their longtime friends and collaborators, Robbie Grunwald on keys, Steve Zsirai on upright bass, and Mark Mariash on drums. We hope you’ll come join in the festivities!"
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "À l’occasion de son 20e anniversaire, le trio vocal canadien Good Lovelies renoue avec sa populaire tournée de Noël. Le spectacle propose un savoureux mélange de classiques du temps des fêtes, de chansons hivernales incontournables et de compositions originales qui ont accompagné le public au fil des deux dernières décennies. Derrière les Good Lovelies, on retrouve Caroline Brooks, Kerri Ough et Susan Passmore, trois auteures-compositrices-interprètes et multi-instrumentistes primées aux Juno et connues pour leurs harmonies vocales sublimes et leur son nostalgique. Mêlant folk-roots, swing rétro, bluegrass, pop et soul, leur musique est la bande sonore parfaite pour le temps des fêtes. Pour l’occasion, elles partageront la scène avec leurs fidèles collaborateurs et amis Robbie Grunwald (claviers), Steve Zsirai (contrebasse) et Mark Mariash (batterie). Une soirée festive à souhait vous attend!"
      }
    ]
  },
