    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We are thrilled to invite you to the third annual Arts Alive Teacher Night! Join us for an evening of workshops, networking, and an optional performance of The King James Bible Play. This new iteration of Teacher Night offers an opportunity to connect with NAC staff and leave with strategies for engaging with the Arts in your classrooms. \n\nOrder of events:\n\n\n\t5:45 to 6:15 - Arrival, registration and networking (light refreshments offered)\n\t6:15 to 7:15 – Workshops (held simultaneously)\n\t\n\t\tWorkshop A – Bilingual\n\t\tWorkshop B –..."
      }
    ],
